        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4 The National Employee Resource Center Steering Committee established by Lucent Technologies and the Unions will continue to include two representatives each from the IBEW SC EM-3 and the CWSA, and four Lucent Technologies representatives. The members of this Committee shall be appointed by the Chairpersons of the National Manufacturing Bargaining Committees for the CWSA, IBEW SC EM-3 and Lucent Technologies. One additional representative from CWSA Operations and IBEW SC T-3 will be appointed by their respective chairs.",
